<title>LATVIA: Latvia's Ventspils reloadings rise in February.</title>
<headline>Latvia's Ventspils reloadings rise in February.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reloadings of crude oil and oil products at Latvia's Ventspils oil terminal in February rose to 2.13 million tonnes, 200,000 tonnes higher than January's levels, the company said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The terminal, one of the main outlets for Russian crude, said in a statement that crude oil reloaded was 1.09 million</p>
